        {
          "id": "d07-s7-p10",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Vendor spend covers contracted annual commitments above the procurement threshold. Renewal dates are contract anniversaries at which terms can be renegotiated or the contract terminated.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
