        {
          "id": "d07-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q2 2025, management expects stable churn and a step-up in enterprise pipeline. Capital expenditure for Q2 2025 is budgeted at $16.2M, the majority allocated to office consolidation.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
